{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 14, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "__m512i _mm512_mask_add_epi32(__m512i a, __mmask16 b, __m512i c, __m512i d)\n  needs: avx512f\n  class: vpaddd (paddb/w/d/q psub pand pandn por pxor)\n  semantics: r = k[i] ? base : src (the first operand), base _mm512_add_epi32: a + b\n  lanes (operand lanes named a0, b3 ...):\n    r0 = b & 1 != 0 ? c0 + d0 : a0\n    r15 = b >> 15 & 1 != 0 ? c15 + d15 : a15\n  cost       lat   rtp uops  ports\n  skx          1 0.495    1  p05\n  glc          1 0.495    1  p05\n  zen4         1   0.5    1  FP0 FP1 FP2 FP3\n  x86v4        1   0.5    1  p05\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 14, "ok": true, "cmd": "intrinsic", "ucas": "intrinsic _mm512_mask_add_epi32", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "intrinsic", "name": "_mm512_mask_add_epi32", "signature": "__m512i _mm512_mask_add_epi32(__m512i a, __mmask16 b, __m512i c, __m512i d)", "features": "avx512f", "class": "vpaddd", "semantics": "a + b", "masking": "r = k[i] ? base : src (the first operand)", "base": "_mm512_add_epi32", "lanes": [{"lane": 0, "expr": "b & 1 != 0 ? c0 + d0 : a0"}, {"lane": 15, "expr": "b >> 15 & 1 != 0 ? c15 + d15 : a15"}], "costs": [{"model": "skx", "latency": 1, "rthroughput": 0.4950000047683716, "uops": 1, "ports": "p05"}, {"model": "glc", "latency": 1, "rthroughput": 0.4950000047683716, "uops": 1, "ports": "p05"}, {"model": "zen4", "latency": 1, "rthroughput": 0.5, "uops": 1, "ports": "FP0 FP1 FP2 FP3"}, {"model": "x86v4", "latency": 1, "rthroughput": 0.5, "uops": 1, "ports": "p05"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "__m512i _mm512_mask_add_epi32(__m512i a, __mmask16 b, __m512i c, __m512i d)\n  needs: avx512f\n  class: vpaddd (paddb/w/d/q psub pand pandn por pxor)\n  semantics: r = k[i] ? base : src (the first operand), base _mm512_add_epi32: a + b\n  lanes (operand lanes named a0, b3 ...):\n    r0 = b & 1 != 0 ? c0 + d0 : a0\n    r15 = b >> 15 & 1 != 0 ? c15 + d15 : a15\n  cost       lat